 of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn the New Year gift exchange activity at school, Li Mingzhu looks forward to giving a gift she carefully selects to her classmate Wang Hao. Teacher Zhang organizes this activity and encourages students to give thoughtful gifts to each other. Li Mingzhu misses the moment when Teacher Zhang reminds everyone to pay attention to food allergies, so she chooses a box of exquisite handmade mooncakes. When exchanging gifts, Li Mingzhu hands the gift to Wang Hao and happily says, \"This mooncake is a specialty of our place, I remember you say you like to try local snacks!\" Wang Hao pauses for a moment, then politely replies, \"Oh, thank you, Mingzhu. I definitely try it.\" Teacher Zhang quietly says, \"Every gift is the other's intention, let's look at the gifts from other students next.\"\n\n[Question]\nDoes Li Mingzhu know that Wang Hao has a food allergy?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Knows\nB. Does not know","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e339d6006945d2804a73","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368313908,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:38:33","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"f9940e4ca7a040f797985fedd8d29e94"}